      "findings": [
        {
          "source_quote": "ἐπὶ κεφαλαίων ποιῆσαι",
          "english_quote": "to arrange under headings",
          "issue": "The expression concerns presentation in principal points or outline. “Arrange under headings” can describe merely organizing otherwise unabridged material and does not adequately express the summarizing force supported by the promised epitome.",
          "suggested_revision": "Compare “to present in outline” or “to summarize in its main points,” retaining “the greater part” as the quantity of material treated. Any replacement requires fresh review.",
          "severity": "minor"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "Κλήμεντος τῶν Πέτρου ἐπιδημίων κηρυγμάτων ἐπιτομή",
          "english_quote": "Clement’s Epitome of Peter’s Preachings during His Sojourns.",
          "issue": "The adjective ἐπιδημίων directly qualifies κηρυγμάτων, but its contextual force remains unresolved. “During His Sojourns” selects a temporal interpretation rather than the alternative association with visits or a local or public sense. The existing note discloses this blocking title uncertainty; print confirmation does not adjudicate it.",
          "suggested_revision": "Provide separate lexical and contextual evidence for ἐπιδήμιος modifying κήρυγμα or comparable activity nouns. Compare the current title with a source-qualified candidate such as “Clement’s Epitome of Peter’s Sojourn-Preachings,” while retaining the alternative senses. Do not substitute wording from another edition or treat any proposed title as accepted before fresh review.",
          "severity": "blocking"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
